    <!-- Developer connection for ADB debugging -->
    <string name="dev_link_title">Ceangal luchd-leasachaidh</string>
    <string name="dev_link_body">Seallaidh e ion-chuir is aplacaidean an TBh, atharraichidh e an t-ion-chur air telebhiseanan nach toir an aire do na putanan HDMI agus suidhichidh e an t-soilleireachd air cuid dhiubh. Tha e ag obair thar ceangal dì-bhugachaidh an TBh (ADB). Obraichidh na putanan is an sgrìobhadh mar an ceudna às aonais.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">Air an TBh, fosgail Settings › System › About agus tagh Android TV OS build seachd tursan. Air telebhiseanan nas sine, ’s e Device Preferences › About › Build a th’ ann.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Fosgail Developer options, ri taobh About, agus cuir USB debugging air. Air Shield, ’s e Network debugging a th’ ann.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_allow">Thoir gnogag air Ceangail, an uairsin cuir cromag ri Always allow air an TBh agus tagh OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Ceangail</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow">Ceadaich air an TBh</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow_body">Cuir cromag ri Always allow from this computer, an uairsin OK</string>
    <string name="dev_link_turn_off">Cuir dheth</string>
    <string name="dev_link_off">Dheth. Cuiridh e ris ion-chuir is a h-uile aplacaid</string>
    <string name="dev_link_away">Chan eil an TBh a’ freagairt. Feuchaidh an aplacaid a-rithist leatha fhèin fhad ’s a tha an cian-smachd fosgailte.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Gun fhreagairt</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">Dhiùlt an TBh an ceangal. Dèan cinnteach gu bheil USB debugging air. O Android TV 14, cha ghabh cuid de thelebhiseanan ach Wireless debugging, rud nach urrainn do TennaRC a chleachdadh fhathast.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Tha dì-bhugachadh dheth air an TBh</string>
